 "text": "Hello, how are you today? Pick a spot out of the wind and shade, and put food and drinks inside a cover. An old sleeping mat roll folded on its edge works well. Some do, the stronger the better. A thick plastic bag over your food helps too. Lemonade is the worst, honey jars are the best. If you' out in the wild, bring something they can't get, like bacon fat. Water bottles are fine as long as you keep them out of reach. If a wasp lands on you, don't swat, it'll chase you all day.",
